[
  {
    "id": 1007001050010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おー、すごい盛り上がってるねー",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00007",
    "bgm": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。アンティーカも、こんな大きな会場で\r\nライブができるところまで来たんだ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お客さんも満員なんだって！　嬉しいなぁ\r\nみんな三峰たちを応援してくれてるんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……大丈夫そうか？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……えへへ。まー楽しんでくるよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あんまり緊張はしてなさそうだな？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうだねぇ\r\nむしろ、いい感じに気持ちが引き締まってる感じかな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのあたりは変わらないなぁ\r\n初めてラジオの収録に行った時のことを思い出すよ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ま、あの時はなんにもわかってなかったってのもあるしね\r\nアイドルとしての自覚、みたいなのも全然なかったから",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー、今考えるとあの新人ポジション、楽しかったな\r\n憧れの人たちがすぐそばにいる！　みたいなお客さん思考で",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……その頃に戻りたいか？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そう言われると、どっちがいいか悩まなくもないかなぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなこと言って、全然悩んでる顔してないくせに",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そう？　だって三峰、超演技派だよー？\r\nプロデューサーが間違ってる可能性、あるんじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ない",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "即答！　そんで断言とか！\r\nうちのＰたん強すぎじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもまぁ……そうかもね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "最初の頃から、\r\nどの仕事も本当に楽しいと思いながらやってたんだけどさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……今考えると、やっぱり、自分はアイドルだって\r\nちゃんと思えてなかった気がするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でも今は、この会場に来てくれたみんなを\r\n楽しませたいってちゃんと思えてる",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ね、プロデューサー。なんだか三峰、\r\nここがアイドルとしての第１歩って感じがするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……やっぱりちょっと遅いかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050150"
  },
  {
    "select": "これから、\r\nもっと頑張らないとな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "もっと自信を持って\r\nいいんじゃないのか？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ずいぶん時間が\r\nかかったな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルとして、しっかりと歩き出すことができたんだ\r\n後はここから、走っていくだけだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そっか……そうだね。出遅れたって、\r\nこっから走り出してみんなに追いつけばいいんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その通りだ。ステージの度に\r\n最高の結華を更新していけば、お客さんも喜んでくれるよ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なるほど。それは難題だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まあ、三峰にどこまでできるかはわかんないけど\r\nほどほどに頑張るとしますか～",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やりすぎて、いつかみたいにプロデューサーに\r\n見つかると大変なことになっちゃうしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの時の結華は頑張りすぎだよ\r\n……だから、結華のペースで進めばいいんだ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "とにもかくにも！　まずはこのライブからだよね\r\nじゃ、行ってくるよ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ううん。三峰はまだ、自分がアイドルだって\r\nわかったばっかだからね",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "最初からアイドルになりたくて頑張ってきた他のみんなには\r\nまだまだ及ばないよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ、でも、別に落ち込んでるわけじゃないから\r\n誤解しないでね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰にとってアイドルって特別だから、\r\nどうしても、基準が厳しくなっちゃうだけだし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺が保証するよ。結華なら絶対、\r\nいつか結華も認めた、素晴らしいアイドルになれる",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おー？　Ｐたんも言うねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ま、先のことはわかんないけど、\r\nとにかく今日はこのステージを頑張ってくるよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お客さんをがっかりさせちゃダメだもんね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。頑張ってこい",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はいはーい\r\n……あ、そうだ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ライブの後、もっとレッスンの予定入れといてくんない？\r\n絶対練習したくなるから！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ！　任せとけ！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050300,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっとー？　Ｐたん、なかなか手厳しいね～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘やかしてばかりじゃ締まらないしな",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050310,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ま、アイドルとしての自覚をもって臨む\r\n初めてのステージだしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それぐらいのパンチをもらった方が\r\n三峰もやる気が出るってもんだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気合い入ってるじゃないか\r\nその調子なら、平気そうだな",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050330,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050340,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でも、まだ最初の一歩踏み出しただけだし、\r\nひとりだと不安だから……ちゃんと見ててね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050350,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーが見ててくれないと、\r\nファンに失望されるアイドルになっちゃうかもしれないから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちゃんと見てるよ\r\nだから今日は、最高のステージにしてきてくれ",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001050360,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もっちろん！　全開で行ってくるね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700105/1007001050360"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]